      },
      {
        "title": "Step 4: Oil",
        "summary": "Applying Otterwax leather oil, which contains safflower and vitamin E, after the salve to polish the boot.",
        "first_segment": 7,
        "last_segment": 8
      },
      {
        "title": "Step 5: Wax",
        "summary": "Applying wax as the final weatherproofing layer, then massaging it in and buffing it with horse hair.",
        "first_segment": 8,
